                      "fill": "$muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "3D-GNOMEᴺᴳ reimplements the 3D-GNOME multiscale Monte Carlo method and its GPU port, cudaMMC. Its loop rewiring at structural variants extends the rules of Sadowski and colleagues. enhancer3D introduced the enhancer to promoter distance profiles shown on the job page.",
