                          "fill": "$muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Yes. Call loops from Hi-C and upload them as your own loops, with the Hi-C as the contact background. Loops called from Hi-C are noisier than ChIA-PET loops, and structures built from them are noisier too.",
